Bringing TW-Uglify up to date with TiddlyWiki's new v5.4.x line.

* Support for new macro parameters-as-attributes
* Support for mvvdisplayinline syntax
* Support for mvv operands in filters
* Many under-the-hood improvements to the testing environment
* ''No'' support for macro parameters in filter operands, because as far as I can tell, it's not actually a feature. Even the examples on tiddlywiki.com don't work. If someone actually wants this, open a github issue.
